package soul.alignment.maintenance-and-sync.alignment-maintenance-protocols.transmutasi-fuel-redirect-protocol.the-redirect-mechanism

analogy "soul.alignment.maintenance-and-sync.maintenance-protocols.transmutasi-redirect.redirect-mechanism.analogy-saat-ownership-illusion-di-break-qs-2-156-energy" {
    body {
        Saat ownership illusion di-break (QS 2:156), energy yang tadinya nge-drive "gue pengen jadi orang baik" atau "gue pengen dipuji" nggak punya target valid lagi. Ego address space nggak exist di memory map. System **auto-route** energy tersebut ke satu-satunya target yang valid: **ridha Allah.**
    }
}
